# Per-repo gate defaults for the orchestrator itself.
#
# portfolio-engine is not a src/-layout Python package — it is a handful of
# scripts and prompts — so the checks that assume that layout are off here.
# They stay ON for every target repo, which is where they matter.
#
# Use the `: "${VAR:=value}"` form so an env var set by CI still wins.
: "${QG_SKIP:=structure,lint,format,types,tests,readme,results,substance}"
